Subject: [PATCH 14/29] Vehicles (holtburger fork): Semi-Truck (semi-379) and
 Articulated Trailers (HBV1 v6)

- HBV1 v6 wire protocol (VehicleWire.cs, 0x090F VehicleTrailerAction/VehicleTrailerState, additive since=6 fields on Vehicle_Profile/Vehicle_State, DeployableKind.TrailerChassis20/40, VehicleEventKind.TrailerHitched/TrailerUnhitched/TwistlockToggled, landblock-local Location.Pos, GameAction/GameEvent routing).
- VehicleProfile.Semi379 (Ironhorse 379 6x4 day-cab, StandInSetup=0x0200026B, FifthWheelOffsetY=-2.01, Z=0.96, 6 liveries, aliases semi/semi-379/truck/tractor/379) & GroundModel vMaxRoad/29 scaling + towMassMul parity.
- TrailerKinematics (30 Hz fifth-wheel articulation, +/-72 deg jackknife clamp, bogie pitch/bank, mounted container pose) & SemiTrailerDeployable (WCID 4000030/4000031, TryMountContainer/UnmountContainer, bridge-aware ground/deck Z sampling, safe tractor despawn unhitch).
- IsoContainerDeployable mounting link (MountedOnTrailerGuid, door lock while moving, Dericost VehicleColliderCache support, immediate tractor TowMassMul/TrailerFlags refresh on destroy).
- VehicleCommands: @vehicle spawn semi [0..5] and @trailer suite (spawn, hitch, unhitch, mount, unmount, twistlock, preset rig20|rig40|rig40hc, list, despawn).

